==Battleground==
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[H. Nah]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Mr. Mole]] spawns.

==Strategy==
You can easily use [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoopmaster Cat]] to permanently freeze the first Super Metal Hippoe and stack [[Long Distance|LD]]/[[Wave Attack|Wave]] attackers to murder everyone here. A good time to stop stacking is when you've sent out your second [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]], or [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] for higher crown clears. Bring at least one unit that can [[Critical|Crit]] so that finishing the stage doesn't take an eternity.

==Trivia==
*Every single enemy here has the [[Knockback|knockback]] ability.

